# publication-gate exemptions.  Format:  rule-name <TAB> path-glob
#
# Each line is a reviewed decision, not a way to quieten the tool. Anything not listed here
# blocks a commit, so keep this short and keep the reasons with it.

# The source-evidence pages record WHY a piece of evidence was excluded: a file downloaded by a
# different concurrent search sat in the same working directory and is explicitly disclaimed
# ("it is NOT my evidence and I make no claim from it"). That provenance is the point of those
# pages and worth more than the jargon costs. Scoped to this one rule -- every other rule still
# applies to these files.
# Follow-up worth doing: reword to drop the agent vocabulary while keeping the substance.
scratch-reference	docs/sourcing/sources/*
scratch-reference	docs/sourcing/wiki/practice/*
scratch-reference	docs/sourcing/wiki/source/*
